<title>FINLAND: SENTRA SIX MONTH PROFIT UP SHARPLY.</title>
<headline>SENTRA SIX MONTH PROFIT UP SHARPLY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   10.1 vs 1.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    8.92 vs 1.17</p>
<p> Net sales				   391.5 vs 340.8</p>
<p> Operating profit			   10.4 vs 2.3</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation 21.4 vs 13.9</p>
<p> Depreciation				 11.0 vs 11.6</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 0.2 vs 0.5 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		  gain 2.9 vs 1.4 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes  13.1 vs 3.2</p>
<p> Taxes					   nil vs 1.4</p>
<p> Net profit				   15.8 vs 3.7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     70.9 vs 63.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish retailing and fast food group is</p>
<p>Sentra Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
</text>
